          "y": 1375,
          "name": "Column filter options",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 230,
          "content": "Reports column filters — every column gets a filter in the filter row:\n• Project / Member: existing autocomplete selects (All projects / All members)\n• Hours: Any · Tracked · 8h+ · 40h+ (existing)\n• Billable: Any · Billable · Non-billable (existing)\n• Billable %: Any · Below 50% · 50%+ · 90%+\n• Last activity: Any time · Today · Last 7 days · Last 30 days\nAggregate filters compare the displayed totals of top-level groups and keep qualifying subtrees; the Total row follows the visible groups. All filters are table-only and never refetch."
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "qIVcG",
          "x": 3876,
          "y": 1375,
          "name": "mobileSavedReportsNote",
          "width": 360,
          "height": 130,
          "content": "Mobile saved reports: chips mirror the desktop saved bar (Admin Reports V2). 'Save as…' / Save open the save sheet (update vs save-as-new). Saved reports sheet: tap applies, ⋯ = rename/delete. Same data contract as desktop — no new filter semantics."
        },
