        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "lNyIn",
          "x": 534,
          "y": 2439,
          "name": "reportResultCardNote",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 300,
          "content": "Report result card — redesign\n\nReplaces the old row (name + child count + a flat Hours/Billable pair) with a scannable, tree-aware card. Same data source, richer read:\n\n• Type badge — project / member / task, so the grouping level is obvious without indentation.\n• Name + context meta (child counts for groups, 'Task · in <project>' for leaves).\n• TRACKED — headline hours (formatPaddedHoursMinutesDuration).\n• BILLABLE — the % (billableShare) as the key ratio, plus a proportional meter (accent-tint track, brand fill) and the billable hours.\n• Last activity (relative) in the footer.\n• Chevron only on parent/group rows → expands into indented children; leaf rows omit it.\n\nStates shown: group (Project Orion, expanded), member leaf, task leaf. Collapsed group = chevron rotated to point right."
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "agTbG",
          "x": 934,
          "y": 2439,
          "name": "Group By Mobile Redesign",
          "clip": true,
          "width": 390,
          "fill": "$color-app-bg",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 14,
          "padding": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Txl0Y",
              "name": "headerBlock",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 4,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FbZR1",
                  "name": "title",
                  "fill": "$color-text-dark",
                  "content": "“Group by” — mobile",
