                      "context": "Status Select supports draft, sent and paid including sent→draft and paid→earlier status. A manual bookkeeping change only. Group is personal. Edit opens full business form for every status; Download PDF exports saved data, not unsaved drafts. Copy starts an independent draft. For an Admin viewing a Draft, Delete invoice follows Edit invoice in the header action row."
