              "context": " Bank transfer fields shown. Card shows Payment provider and Payment link (optional, HTTPS). Other/custom shows generic Beneficiary, Bank / payment provider, Account / payment details. Terms and instructions are common. Preserve inactive local values across switches; render only selected-method fields in detail/PDF. Retain hidden beneficiary/account/SWIFT/paymentUrl values. Provider, terms and instructions are shared across methods. Only Card exposes and renders a payment link."
