        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "i527_1526",
          "name": "Invoice interactions — design contract",
          "width": 600,
          "gap": 16,
          "padding": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1515",
              "content": "Interaction contract · #527",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "fill": "$color-text-dark"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1516",
              "content": "Personal groups",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "fill": "$color-text-dark"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1517",
              "content": "Flat, private groups belong to one user in one workspace. Move changes only that user’s membership. All invoices and Ungrouped are built-in views. Delete group preserves invoices.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fill": "$color-text-muted",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "height": 100
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1518",
              "content": "Status and editing",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "fill": "$color-text-dark"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1519",
              "content": "Select Draft, Sent or Paid in either direction. Edit all business fields in every status. Save invoice fields, included entries and totals together. Excluding time entries preserves tracked time.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fill": "$color-text-muted",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "height": 100
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1520",
              "content": "Copy and PDF",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "fill": "$color-text-dark"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1521",
              "content": "Create from invoice opens an independent draft with a new reference. Previously billed entries are unavailable. PDF uses saved details and selected entries; it contains no personal-group information.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fill": "$color-text-muted",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "height": 100
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1522",
              "content": "Settings and permissions",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "fill": "$color-text-dark"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1523",
              "content": "Admin manages sender and payment defaults. Invoice-specific overrides are snapshots. Authorized PMs use safe invoice defaults within their existing project permissions.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fill": "$color-text-muted",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "height": 90
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1524",
              "content": "Mobile and recovery",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "fill": "$color-text-dark"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1525",
              "content": "Below 640px: cards and full-width filters. Dialogs fit the viewport with a scrollable body and reachable actions. Errors preserve drafts and selection; loading, empty and failure states remain distinct.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fill": "$color-text-muted",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "height": 110
            }
          ],
          "layout": "vertical",
          "fill": "$color-surface",
          "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
          "stroke": "$color-divider",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "strokeAlignment": "inner",
          "x": 64,
          "y": 5800
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "i527_1532",
          "name": "No eligible time entries",
          "width": 375,
          "gap": 16,
          "padding": 20,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1527",
              "content": "No billable entries found",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "fill": "$color-text-dark",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "height": 46
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i527_1528",
              "content": "Change the project or billing period to look for entries. You can still create an empty draft.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "fill": "$color-text-muted",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "height": 76
            },
            {
