                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "fill": "$color-surface",
                      "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
                      "stroke": "$color-divider",
                      "strokeWidth": 1,
                      "strokeAlignment": "inner",
                      "context": "Admin-only editable workspace defaults. Authorized PMs receive invoice-safe defaults through invoice defaults, not full workspace Settings. Optional logo has upload/remove controls and must not block creation or PDF when absent. Validation and save-error retain draft values. Save changes affects new invoice defaults only; invoice-specific overrides remain editable. Bank transfer fields shown. Card shows Payment provider and Payment link (optional, HTTPS). Other/custom shows generic Beneficiary, Bank / payment provider, Account / payment details. Terms and instructions are common. Preserve inactive local values across switches; render only selected-method fields in detail/PDF. Retain hidden beneficiary/account/SWIFT/paymentUrl values. Provider, terms and instructions are shared across methods. Only Card exposes and renders a payment link."
                    },
