          "cornerRadius": 12,
          "context": "Mobile Admin-only invoice default section. Fields stack full width, body scrolls, save remains reachable. Logo is optional. Existing invoice snapshots are not rewritten. Bank transfer fields shown. Card shows Payment provider and Payment link (optional, HTTPS). Other/custom shows generic Beneficiary, Bank / payment provider, Account / payment details. Terms and instructions are common. Preserve inactive local values across switches; render only selected-method fields in detail/PDF. Retain hidden beneficiary/account/SWIFT/paymentUrl values. Provider, terms and instructions are shared across methods. Only Card exposes and renders a payment link.",
